Third-party material

This product bundles third-party material under its own licenses, listed below. The per-file
list (author, source, license) is in ATTRIBUTION.md.

Repository assets are original to GridCraft. Optional CRAFT_FONTS_DIR builds also embed
OFL-1.1 Regular Hans/Hant faces selected from craft-fonts/fonts/manifest.txt for PDF fallback.
The manifest supplies authors, source and verified SHA256; packaging/env.sh carries the font
licenses alongside the application. No font binary is stored in this repository.

Unicode glyph outlines use ttf-parser (MIT OR Apache-2.0). Its transitive dependencies
retain their respective licenses (Cargo.lock).
